/*
 * Natural Language Grounded Search v4.0.0
 * Changes in v4.0.0 (H2 2026 Frontier Harness Refactor — Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite & Gemini 4+):
 * - Parent-Steered Search & Conditional Router Bypass: Added optional adversarialQuery, includeDomains, excludeDomains, and freshness params; bypasses internal LLM router when parent supplies steering or in MINIMAL/documentUrl-only mode, while preserving internal router for bare queries.
 * - Lean UCS Extraction & S1..Sn Handles: Removed weak-model prescriptive coaching fields (preferred_action, actionability_limit, redundant required_caveat) in favor of concise premises-first reconciliation_notes; unified S1..Sn source handles across SIFT, lattice, UCS, and Decision-1 entailment with deterministic invalid-handle rejection.
 * - Quote Recovery & Combined Admission Gate: Added deterministic raw-span quote recovery (arXiv:2609.15964) before gating; drops unverified non-PDF claims that fail BOTH quote recovery and Decision-1 direct entailment (eliminating soft-flag laundering without BrowseComp-Verify over-rejection).
 * - Parent-Driven Multi-Hop Default: Defaulted enable_hop2_verification to "on_failure_only" (triggering internal Hop-2 only on >=50% entailment rejection or zero surviving claims) and exposed suggested_followup_axes + paywalled_domains so Gemini 4 orchestrates parallel follow-ups natively.
 * - Row-Aware Parent Output Cap & Universal Workspace Spill: Added row-aware enforceParentOutputCap (12K/24K/40K/36K by mode) preventing parent context rot and broken JSON; spills oversized hydrated sources (>=12K chars) and full RAW_TEXT corpora to workspace/in/.
 * - Gemini 4 Calibration & Security: Calibrated default UCS thinking_level to "medium" (high only in EXHAUSTIVE), added neon/hydrogen xhigh support, generalized Gemini 4 native office block support, deduplicated sift_audit metadata, and added per-call randomized XML boundary nonces for untrusted scraped text.
